d the original IP programs. As more offline activities continue to take place in the remainder of uh, 2020, we expect our uh, brand advertising revenues to achieve uh, double digit growth the first quarter. Uh, however, on the other hand, uh, our performance based advertising continues to face challenges during the third quarter, mainly due to uh, I think the following two vectors. First, some of our clients were subject to stricter industry regulations and therefore, uh, they had to adopt a more conservative ad placement strategy. And uh, secondly, the overall supply of uh, the inventory in the market exceeded the market demand, uh, which made raising the uh, ECPM's of performance based adverti- advertising uh, more difficult. Uh, the sector- the top five industries covered by our advertising business are auto, eCommerce, FMCG, financial services and internet services. Uh, those industries, which have traditionally accounted for a substantial portion of our advertising revenues, uh, including auto and uh, uh, <inaudible>, were mostly impacted in the first half of the year. However, as the pandemic gradually brought under control in the third quarter, both industries have since recovered significantly. Uh, in regards to the auto market, uh, the industry continue to show strong signs of recovery uh, in the period. According to China Passenger Car Association, in September, retial sales of passenger cars increased by uh, about 7.3% year over year, wholesale sales of new energy passenger cars increased by uh, more than 90% year over year. As such, we expect the auto sector to continue their recovery in the fourth quarter. The online advertising industry has been uh, underperforming due to the reverse of the epidemic in certain areas of China, uh, as well as this year's geopolitical issues. So far, video and eCommerce were the only sources of advertising growth in this quarter, while the rest of the industry underperformed. In recognition of the changing market dynamics